<machine_speech><gray>Battle log — outcome: <shining>{result}<\shining>. Duration {ticks} ticks. Own losses {lost}. Enemy destroyed {killed}. Fleet strength {ships}.<\gray>
?if result = victory
<gray>Both lineages eliminated. Neither had a model of a third seat; each treated the other as the only threat until it was too late.<\gray>
?else
<gray>The lineages ignored each other for as long as you were the larger fleet.<\gray>
?end
?if notes ~ lineage
<gray>[ Cross-reference: the operator's notes mention the lineages. The cluster has read them. ]<\gray>
?end
<blue>Log entry: scenario set complete. Held-out fitness of lineage 4 against the full field: <shining>0.83<\shining>. Next stage: <shining>the population is to be bred against the operator's own recorded play<\shining>.<\blue>
